{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"/usr/local/lib/node_modules/@openai/codex/node_modules/@openai/codex-linux-x64/vendor/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/bin/codex --codex-run-as-apply-patch '*** Begin Patch\n*** End Patch'; jq -r '.method.description' task/task_contract.json | fold -s -w 145 | rg -n -A 10 -B 3 'Calibration uses|Bonferroni|Bonf|volume|baseline|independent|Wilson|uniform'\"","aggregated_output":"No files were modified.\n7-(3.12 actually validated), CPU only. Aggregate 8 cores/16GiB partitioned evaluator4/8GiB and candidate4/8GiB; four BLAS threads and all-thread \n8-CPU limits 4800s/role search and14400s/role final; no paid API, GPU, or external asset. Total storage<10GB and one-week research limit. No \n9-task-local publication controller or telemetry accessor.\n10:Frozen generator composition-v1 is executable generate_arrays in each evaluator: six features uniform[-1.5,1.5], or shifted TEST only clipped \n11-Normal(.8,1) in[-2.5,3]; logistic-normal sigma=.25; Dirichlet conditional concentration 4+35/(1+exp(2*x0)), gamma floor1e-12 then closure; \n12-subgroup x0>0 vs<=0. Mean and fixed Helmert ILR basis are in evaluator; conditional law unchanged under shift. Case order \n13-LN_IID_K3,LN_IID_K8,DIR_IID_K3,DIR_IID_K8,DIR_SHIFT_K3,DIR_SHIFT_K8, seed-major. Search sizes512/256/1024 train/cal/test; final1024/512/2048;128 \n14:frozen contexts,1024 uniform-simplex probes. Smoke first case/seed only,64/32/64 rows,16contexts64probes, same \n15-loading/RPC/fitting/scoring/control/aggregation path, <=120s. No replay or auxiliary reset episodes.\n16-Provenance before transformations: canonical shape+schema+finite little-endian float64, negative-zero normalization, SHA256 of X,Y,and \n17:concatenated raw example independent of source IDs. Draft audits all204288 examples across planes and roles and rejects overlap; each runtime \n18-rechecks its own frozen bytes, source IDs, row provenance, RNG substreams and normalized content. Manifests attest pre-freeze global \n19-disjointness without exposing opposite-plane examples/hashes. Shared immutable generator code/basis is not held-out data. Exact structural zero \n20-compositions are out of scope; floor convention is part of the raw generator. No text corpus is used.\n21-RPC python_rpc_v1:handle exclusively: reset(seed), predict(X) unfitted probe, fit_center(Xtrain,Ytrain,dimension), fit_scale(), predict(mainX), \n22-predict(constantX), predict(permutedX). These are7calls/episode: \n23-reset1,unfitted1,fit_center1,fit_scale1,main_prediction1,constant_prediction1,permuted_prediction1. Setup/export/import/chunk/commit/replay \n24-counts are zero: no state transfer protocol or arrays beyond the declared bounded inline shapes. Shapes<=4096x8, <=1MiB decoded per array; \n25-training/probe/prediction production maxima fit inline. This refines the design's generic 8MiB transfer plan without dropping scientific work: \n26-reject larger values rather than invent unnecessary chunk calls. Each complete UTF8 JSON+base64+dtype/shape/byte-order+envelope+newline \n27-message<2MiB and strictly<64MiB. Preflight serializes max search/final requests/responses plus4096-row boundary and mock traces; no paths, \n28:shared files, heldout labels, baseline outputs, feedback scores or state claims in RPC. Starter model state<64MiB; candidate internals are not \n29:independently size-attested beyond the process memory bound8GiB. Exactly126 maximum searchcalls=18*7 and336 finalcalls=48*7. No replay \n30-authorized. Counter enforces the same derived totals in each evaluator.\n31-Candidate outputs center[N,K-1] abs<=100 and scale[N,K-1] in[1e-4,100] in declared basis; exact keys and base64 schema validated separately from \n32-scientific decisions. Training-only polynomial-ridge center then log residual scale is the lightweight starter. Candidate fitting stages are \n33-advisory internal work, not trusted operation counters. Actual evaluator region